{"id": 998393, "slug": "frankies-funclub", "name": "Frankie's FunClub", "name_original": "Frankie's FunClub", "description": "<p>Enter into the long-since defunct <strong>Frankie's Funclub!</strong> Where parties used to fill the air with laughter and activity - now, it lies abandoned, and has fallen prey to scavengers, like you! Sneak around in this thrilling thief-simulator finding valuable (and sometimes suspicious) LOOT.</p><p>Resell on the black market for <strong>PROFIT, upgrades, and secret unlockable content.</strong> You're not alone, however, and <strong>certain threats</strong> hang around every corner, hungry for attention!</p><ul><li><p>Avoid detection from the wandering residents and security cameras of the FunClub by sneaking, hiding from, and distracting them!</p></li><li><p>Collect valuable merchandise from the Club's glory days to earn a profit</p></li><li><p>Snag photos of the girls to sell online from your own furnishable hideout!</p></li><li><p>Disguise yourself and walk among the girls to succeed!</p></li><li><p>In-game achievements for thieves who explore every inch of the FunClub</p></li><li><p>Over a dozen scenes to snatch up!</p></li><li><p>10+ findable looping VHS tapes~</p></li></ul><p>Welcome to Frankie's FunClub!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-02-25", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-07-19T13:04:17", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b88/b8893a7aad01b2e533b302e28bbbd2fb.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/616/6164880b89bf2ab22b68372d4982a3ae.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 2, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": {"1": 1, "2": 1, "3": 1}, "added": 4, "added_by_status": {"owned": 3, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 14, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name"